        RULES["Mandatory Grounding Rules:<br/>1. Use ONLY facts from provided sources.<br/>2. If missing/insufficient info, output EXACTLY:<br/>   'I don't know based on the provided papers.'<br/>3. Cite paper title and page number for every claim."]
